# Listing approval (ops / REST Client)
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
# @adminToken = <Admin or Moderator JWT>
# @listingId = <business uuid>

### Queue (pending listings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/listings?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get one listing (any status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/listings/{{listingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approve (makes listing public)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/listings/{{listingId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reject (keeps listing off the public catalog)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/listings/{{listingId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Incomplete profile — missing logo and address"
}

### Public catalog (no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings

### Public listing by id (404 until approved)
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/{{listingId}}

### Merchant resubmit after rejection
# @merchantToken = <Merchant JWT>
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchant/listing/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
